OxyOS's system wallpapers (/usr/share/oxyos/wallpapers, docs/adr/0048-wallpapers.mdx)

Every wallpaper here was made for OxyOS on 7 November 2026 from nothing but a script of the
repository's, scripts/make-wallpapers.py: SVG documents of linear and radial gradients, ellipses
and smooth paths whose colours and shapes are the script's own numbers (its few random choices
seeded, so every run writes the same bytes). No photograph, drawing or other work was used, and
none imitates another vendor's wallpaper. The gradients' hues are those of Bloom's accent colours
(@oxy.so/bloom's APP_COLOR_PRESETS), which are OxyHQ's.

